      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chenega%2C_Alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Chugach Alutiiq people have inhabited the coastal areas of Prince William Sound, including Chenega Island, for over 4,400 years before European contact.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/chenega_alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Chenega remains isolated, reachable only by boat or small aircraft, reflecting its remote coastal setting.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
